// `Time` and `Duration` are distinct types over `Int`: a time plus a duration is a time, a time minus a time is a duration, a literal coerces to either by demand.
Fact deadline Identified by Time
Fact window Identified by Duration.
+deadline(10).
+window(3).
?(Current Time + window < deadline).
?(deadline - Current Time == 10).
?(Current Time + 2 == 2).
?(window + window == 6).
